# The Tear-it cast: one row per character (owner 2026-11-05: our own version of ALL characters, similar in style to RPG Maker, clearly our brand).
#   CAST | id | skin | hair_style (short long mohawk none) | hair | garment | trim | body (0 slim 1 normal 2 broad) | mark (1 = gold chain and wrist)
#   GENERIC | prefix | count | seed      -> prefix_00.. from a fixed palette by hash (the 80 generic NPCs are rows like this)
# Asa and Ava follow the owner's portrait description (TEAR-IT-TILES-100, answer 3). Harold's look is NOT documented: this row is a placeholder for the owner to change.
