# ===== The Soul Pen and TSOTS cast, drawn from the IP (owner 2026-11-05: "we should draw from our ip themes whenever possible"). =====
# Source: BOOK 22.lore-ip (SOUL-PEN-LORE-SUMMARY, BOOK-BY-BOOK-SUMMARIES-AND-WORLD-RULES, MAP-ATLAS) and the soul-pen-lore skill.
# Every row says what is documented (READ) and what I chose (DOC). A DOC colour is a proposal for the owner, NOT canon.
# New styles: masked (full-face mask in the hair colour, eye slits in the trim colour), clown (white paint, red nose, wig in the hair colour).
# New mark: 2 = an echo, a translucent Time Twin. New kinds: plant, jelly.
# --- people ---
# Sol: READ masked leader of the lunar society, wields the SolPen, Temporal Body Suit that holds his flickering atoms, future Lucky. DOC: silver mask, dark suit, cyan slits.
CAST | sol          | #d6a47c | masked | #c9ced6 | #1a1d2e | #7ad0ff | 2 | 0
# Lucky: READ Shepherd/Starr, Shepherd's Farm on Mars, Sol's past self. DOC: Mars-rust work clothes, short brown hair.
CAST | lucky        | #d6a47c | short  | #4a3020 | #8a4a2e | #ffd24a | 1 | 0
# Time Twin of Lucky: READ a translucent temporal echo that fights beside you (Footrace Fu). The same figure at 55 percent opacity.
CAST | lucky_twin   | #d6a47c | short  | #4a3020 | #8a4a2e | #7ad0ff | 1 | 2
